# Security Rules

See `docs/SECURITY.md`.

## MUST

- Keep secrets out of git; update `.env.example` for new vars
- Prefer least-privilege IAM and blocked-public S3
- Use GitHub Actions secrets for AWS credentials

## MUST NOT

- Commit `.env`, PEMs, or access keys
- Broaden IAM `Resource: "*"` without human review
- Bake env files into the webpack bundle
